' Autonomous Enterprise boundary visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-011 §20 + ADR-ES-011 §6 + §18.
' Illustrates the Autonomous Enterprise boundary against adjacent
' constructs.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml autonomous-enterprise-boundary

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Autonomous Enterprise, Boundary Distinctions

rectangle "Autonomous Enterprise" as ae #FFE4B5

rectangle "Enterprise" as enterprise #E0E8F0
rectangle "AI Enterprise" as ai #FFE4E1
rectangle "Automated Enterprise" as automated #FFE4E1
rectangle "Agentic Enterprise" as agentic #FFE4E1
rectangle "Autonomous Operations" as aops #FFFACD
rectangle "Autonomous Value Stream" as avs #E6E6FA
rectangle "Automation" as automation #C8C8C8

enterprise -[#4682B4]- ae : specialises
ae -[#888888]- ai : AE-AUTO-NEG-005 (NOT)
ae -[#888888]- automated : AE-AUTO-NEG-006 (NOT)
ae -[#888888]- agentic : AE-AUTO-NEG-003 (NOT)
ae -[#888888]- aops : AE-AUTO-NEG-017 (NOT)
ae -[#888888]- avs : AE-AUTO-NEG-018 (NOT)
ae -[#888888]- automation : AE-AUTO-CON-012 (NOT sufficient)
ae -[#888888,thickness=2]- enterprise : AE-AUTO-CON-013 (orthogonal to Agentic Enterprise)

note bottom of ae
  Per AE-AUTO-CON-002 + AE-AUTO-CON-017:
  Autonomous Enterprise is established by material
  enterprise-level autonomous operation, not by
  possessing Autonomous Operations (AE-AUTO-NEG-007),
  not by using automation (AE-AUTO-NEG-006),
  not by eliminating humans (AE-AUTO-NEG-012),
  not by unlimited authority (AE-AUTO-NEG-014).
end note

@enduml
